The request uses the `super_api` key, limits the result set to **15** items, and sets the cursor to `"next_set"` so that you can paginate further if needed.

```http
GET https://www.virustotal.com/api/v3/ip_addresses/178.34.55.101/communicating_files?limit=15&cursor=next_set
Authorization: Bearer <super_api>
Accept: application/json
```

